1
00:00:21,745 --> 00:00:30,992
Kneeling on the cold church wood, 
Before the bleeding cross I stood.

2
00:00:31,266 --> 00:00:42,384
“Lord, I love my Luna so, 
Give me strength to let her know.”

3
00:00:43,644 --> 00:00:52,873
Suddenly, a scent of blood, 
Rising fire from the mud.

4
00:00:53,176 --> 00:01:03,856
In my chest, the cage of bone, 
Something wild has claimed its throne.

5
00:01:03,988 --> 00:01:14,728
I am rising, fierce and strong, 
No more hiding where I don’t belong!

6
00:01:14,952 --> 00:01:26,044
No more rules and no more pain, 
The sleeping lion breaks his chain!

7
00:01:26,054 --> 00:01:36,606
Let the golden amber burn, 
There is no way to return!

8
00:01:36,837 --> 00:01:53,038
Hear my voice begin to roar, 
As I claim my life once more!

9
00:02:10,918 --> 00:02:20,267
Golden fur upon my skin, 
Senses sharp, the hunts begin.

10
00:02:20,420 --> 00:02:31,495
Claws are tearing through my glove, 
Screaming Luna's name with love.

11
00:02:32,428 --> 00:02:41,907
Four heavy paws upon the floor, 
Creeping to the stairway door.

12
00:02:42,249 --> 00:02:53,092
Every wooden step will creak, 
For the words I long to speak.

13
00:02:53,206 --> 00:03:04,135
I am rising, fierce and strong, 
No more hiding where I don’t belong!

14
00:03:04,171 --> 00:03:14,765
No more rules and no more pain, 
The sleeping lion breaks his chain!

15
00:03:15,081 --> 00:03:25,572
Let the golden amber burn, 
There is no way to return!

16
00:03:25,895 --> 00:03:42,095
Hear my voice begins to roar, 
As I claim my life once more!

